Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:00.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Si haces más de tres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.28,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de estas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}normal que no te sienta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:02.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:03.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Dices que sí a todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:04.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}para que nadie se enfade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:04.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}contigo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:05.82,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te comparas con la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que los demás enseñan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:07.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por redes y que sabes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:08.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es falsa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te prometes cosas que luego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:10.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no cumples
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:10.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Necesitas que alguien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:11.81,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te valide para sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que vales
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Tapas lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:13.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con el móvil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.28,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con la fiesta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:15.17,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con los videojuegos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:15.77,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o con el alcohol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.08,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Consumes cada día justo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:17.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te baja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:18.08,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Hablas desde la queja todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:19.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el puto día
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.81,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te rodeas de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:21.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que te resta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:22.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que no tiene ambición
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:22.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Nunca te paras a estar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:23.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en silencio y a escuchar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.57,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que sientes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.43,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y vives en tu cabeza
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pensando sin parar y nunca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:27.58,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te has parado a mirar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de dónde viene todo eso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:29.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que es de lo que viviste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:29.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de pequeño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:30.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que no te hace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}falta quererte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:31.64,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te sobra todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que te quita energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:33.53,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empieza por una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.04,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la que más te ha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.02,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}dolido escucharla
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.09,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y verás cómo cambia todo
